      tips: ["Take at least 20–25 full-length mocks before the actual exam", "Sectional accuracy matters more than attempting every question", "Build a reading habit months in advance — verbal ability improves slowly, not overnight", "If targeting a global MBA later, consider GMAT prep alongside since the quant overlap is high"],
